  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\int_{\\sqrt{2}}^x \\frac{d t}{t \\sqrt{t^2-1}}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$\\left[\\sec ^{-1} t\\right]_{\\sqrt{2}}^x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$\\sec ^{-1} x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$\\sec ^{-1} x=\\frac{3 \\pi}{4}$\n$x=-\\sqrt{2}$."
